    "raw": "{\"ruleId\":\"item-3c6ec8987899\",\"class\":\"partial\",\"constraints\":[{\"id\":\"skill-md-outside-skills-dir\",\"type\":\"forbiddenPattern\",\"pattern\":\"^\\\\+\\\\+\\\\+ (?!skills/[^/]+/).*SKILL\\\\.md$\",\"path\":\".floor/added-lines.txt\"}],\"coverage\":\"Flags a change that adds to or creates a SKILL.md file whose path is not under skills/<name>/. This is the literal form of adding a skill outside the skills directory.\",\"residual\":\"Does this hunk add a skill outside skills/<name>/ in some form other than a misplaced SKILL.md file, or add a SKILL.md whose frontmatter lacks a name or a description field?\",\"probes\":{\"violating\":{\"patch\":\"diff --git a/docs/SKILL.md b/docs/SKILL.md\\nnew file mode 100644\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/docs/SKILL.md\\n@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\\n+---\\n+name: pdf\\n+description: Handle PDF files\\n+---\\n+Body text.\\n\"},\"compliant\":{\"patch\":\"diff --git a/skills/pdf/SKILL.md b/skills/pdf/SKILL.md\\nnew file mode 100644\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/skills/pdf/SKILL.md\\n@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\\n+---\\n+name: pdf\\n+description: Handle PDF files\\n+---\\n+Body text.\\n\"}},\"rationale\":\"The headers in added-lines.txt expose each changed path, so a SKILL.md outside skills/<name>/ can be matched mechanically. Checking that frontmatter contains both name and description means proving something is absent across several lines, which line-by-line patterns cannot do. Recognising a skill that is not a SKILL.md file also needs judgement.\"}",
